 R. James\">Brian R. James</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Ed_Greenwood\" title=\"Ed Greenwood\">Ed Greenwood</a> (September 2007). <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Grand_History_of_the_Realms\" title=\"The Grand History of the Realms\">The Grand History of the Realms</a></i>. Edited by <a href=\"/wiki/Kim_Mohan\" title=\"Kim Mohan\">Kim Mohan</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Penny_Williams\" title=\"Penny Williams\">Penny Williams</a>. (<a href=\"/wiki/Wizards_of_the_Coast\" title=\"Wizards of the Coast\">Wizards of the Coast</a>), p. 118. ISBN <a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/978-0-7869-4731-7\" title=\"Special:BookSources/978-0-7869-4731-7\">978-0-7869-4731-7</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-GHR-p147-10\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-GHR-p147_10-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Brian_R._James\" title=\"Brian R. James\">Brian R. James</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Ed_Greenwood\" title=\"Ed Greenwood\">Ed Greenwood</a> (September 2007). <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Grand_History_of_the_Realms\" title=\"The Grand History of the Realms\">The Grand History of the Realms</a></i>. Edited by <a href=\"/wiki/Kim_Mohan\" title=\"Kim Mohan\">Kim Mohan</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Penny_Williams\" title=\"Penny Williams\">Penny Williams</a>. (<a href=\"/wiki/Wizards_of_the_Coast\" title=\"Wizards of the Coast\">Wizards of the Coast</a>), p. 147. ISBN <a href=\"/wiki/Special:BookSources/978-0-7869-4731-7\" title=\"Special:BookSources/978-0-7869-4731-7\">978-0-7869-4731-7</a>.</span>\n</li>\n<li id=\"cite_note-GHR-p150-11\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-GHR-p150_11-0\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\"><a href=\"/wiki/Brian_R._James\" title=\"Brian R. James\">Brian R. James</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Ed_Greenwood\" title=\"Ed Greenwood\">Ed Greenwood</a> (September 2007). <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Grand_History_of_the_Realms\" title=\"The Grand History of the Realms\">The Grand History of the Realms</a></i>. Edited by <a href=\"/wiki/Kim_Mohan\"